# promise: #905
# Open Passwords (#905): "passwords" in the command bar finds it, and it opens Chromium's password manager for the
# space's profile, searched for the site the window shows, so that site's logins are the ones listed.
budget rss=900 stalls50=20
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=site
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
wait 2
cra://commandbar?query=passwords
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarRows=passwords
expect-log Cra command bar rows passwords: open=1 .*Open Passwords
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://action/openPasswords
wait 3
cra://debug?selectedTab=passwords
expect-log selected tab passwords: chrome://password-manager/passwords\?q=127\.0\.0\.1$
